  "profile": {
    "storyTitle": "Profile",
    "text": "Crackborne, real name Tonya, is a former worker from Zelgrad, Ursus. She once launched a resistance movement in Zelgrad under the name of 'Reunion,' and later came to Rhodes Island for treatment on Crownslayer's recommendation. She now participates in Rhodes Island field operations as a full-fledged Operator."
